    "description": "<p>Flowers sprout from the ground at your feet, filling the air with paralyzing pollen.</p><p>All other creatures within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of you must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check or be <strong>Incapacitated</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>This spell only affects living, physical creatures that need to breathe.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.nnjKtFDUlwsbsuiL]{Paralytic Bloom}</p>",
